    <item>
      <title>Cover Art: Getz/Gilberto</title>
      <link>https://mickqian.github.io/posts/music/cover-arts/cover-art---getz-gilberto/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 14:38:49 +0800</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mickqian.github.io/posts/music/cover-arts/cover-art---getz-gilberto/</guid>
      <description>A brief, objective intro to the album cover of Getz/Gilberto (1964)</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div align="center">
<iframe allow="autoplay *; encrypted-media *;" frameborder="0" height="450" style="width:100%;max-width:760px;overflow:hidden;background:transparent;" sandbox="allow-forms allow-popups allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-storage-access-by-user-activation allow-top-navigation-by-user-activation" src="https://embed.music.apple.com/us/album/getz-gilberto/1422655717"></iframe>
</div>
<h2 id="cover-art---getzgilberto">Cover Art - Getz/Gilberto</h2>
<div align="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px; margin-top: 20px">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250808160430414.png" width="820" alt="Getz/Gilberto" align="center">
<div style="color: #666; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 0px;">Getz/Gilberto</div>
</div>
<p>1964 年 3 月 18 日，<strong>Verve Records</strong> 发布了《Getz/Gilberto》，该专辑获得了当年格莱美的 9 个提名，其中包括 《Best Album Cover》</p>
<p>其封面选用了 波多黎各籍 抽象表现主义的塑料艺术家 <strong>Olga Albizu</strong> 的一幅作品: 《Alla Africa》，直译为“整个非洲”</p>
<h2 id="封面布局">封面布局</h2>
<p>专辑封面底色为正黑色，详细信息位于中间偏右的位置，整体色调以橙色为主</p>
<div align="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250808160430414.png" width="720" alt="Getz/Gilberto" align="center">
<div style="color: #666; font-size: 11px; margin-top: 0px;">Getz/Gilberto</div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>左上角是专辑的目录号：V6-8545，使用小号灰色粗体字体，对应美国发行的立体声版本的目录号</li>
<li>左下角是发行厂商 <strong>Verve</strong> 的灰色 logo</li>
<li>详细信息呈现在中间靠右的位置，从上向下依次为：
<ul>
<li>&ldquo;GETZ/GILBERTO&rdquo;：专辑名，人名部分使用大号橙色字体，slash sign 使用亮黄色字体</li>
<li>&ldquo;STAN GETZ JOAO GILBERTO&rdquo;：乐手，分两行展示，使用中号、颜色更深的橙色字体</li>
<li>&ldquo;featuring Antonio Carlos Jobim&rdquo;：合作乐手，分两行展示，使用小号亮黄色字体</li>
<li>Olga Albizu 的 《Alla Africa》 画作</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>右上角是中号的灰色 &ldquo;Stereo&rdquo; 字样，代表专辑的声道制式</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="封面细节">封面细节</h2>
<ul>
<li>专辑封面选用的画作是下面这幅《Alla Africa》，Albizu 用几乎呈矩形的黑色，橙色和黄色点涂上色的方式呈现了清晰的笔触</li>
</ul>
<div align="center">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250808155643300.webp" width="320" alt="描述文本" align="center">
<div style="color: #777; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px;">Alla Africa</div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>字体方面选用了 <strong>Folio Extra Bold</strong>, 这是一种无衬线字体，属于新 grotesque 风格</li>
</ul>
<div align="center">
<img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/FolioSP01.png/1920px-FolioSP01.png" width="320" alt="描述文本" align="center">
<div style="color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 10px;"></div>
</div>
<ul>
<li>巴西籍 jazz 吉他手 <strong>João Gilberto</strong> 名字上的波浪号在正面和背面都被省略了（但内袖上没有）</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="其他">其他</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Albizu</strong> 还有一些风格相似的作品：</li>
</ul>
<div align="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250811210448020.png" width="710" alt="描述文本" align="center">
</div>
<ul>
<li>除了《Getz/Gilberto》之外，Albizu 的画作还被用于其他经典 cool jazz 专辑封面：
<ul>
<li>Jazz Samba, Stan Getz &amp; Charlie Byrd, 1962</li>
<li>Big Band Bossa Nova, Stan Getz, 1962</li>
<li>Jazz Samba Encore!, Stan Getz &amp; Luiz Bonfa, 1963</li>
<li>Getz/Gilberto, Stan Getz &amp; João Gilberto, 1964</li>
<li>Trio 64, Bill Evans, 1964</li>
<li>Getz/Gilberto Vol. 2, Stan Getz &amp; João Gilberto, 1966</li>
<li>Getz/Gilberto &lsquo;76, Stan Getz &amp; João Gilberto, 1976</li>
<li>Getz/Gilberto + 50, Goro Ito, 2013</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<div align="center" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250811213433124.png" width="710" alt="描述文本" align="center">
<div style="color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 30px">使用 Albizu 作品的其他封面</div>
</div>
<h2 id="heading"></h2>
<ul>
<li>Antonio Carlos Jobim 在专辑封面上选择颇有创意，他的另一张全球畅销专辑 《Wave》选择了一张长颈鹿在浅水中站立的图像 （某些版本为翠绿色，其他为猩红色）。这张专辑也因此得名 <strong>the red giraffe album</strong></li>
</ul>
<div align="center">
<img src="../../../Attachments/Music/Cover%20Arts/Cover%20Art%20-%20Getz%20Gilberto/IMG-20250811214415102.png" width="700" alt="描述文本" align="center">
<div style="color: #666; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 30px">《Wave》 专辑封面</div>
</div>
<h2 id="评价">评价</h2>
<p>艺术评论家和历史学家 <strong>Susan Noye Platt</strong> 曾这样描述 Albizu 与 bossa nova 的关系：</p>
<blockquote>
<p>In the case of Albizu, the connection to music, and particularly bossa nova, as well as her exposure to Hans Hofmann’s ideas of ‘push and pull,’ allows for the work to exist without other reference points. The colors do indeed <strong>move like large full sounds</strong>, a connection that takes us all the way back to Kandinsky.</p>
</blockquote>
]]></content:encoded>
    </item>
    
